give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Irrational Behaviour\"", "italic": true, "color": "green"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Noble", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 3 players, 1 and only 1 of which is evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Shugenja", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing if your closest evil player is clockwise or anti-clockwise. If equidistant, this info is arbitrary."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "High Priestess", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, learn which player the Storyteller believes you should talk to most."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Village Idiot", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: you learn their alignment. [+0 to +2 Village Idiots. 1 of the extras is drunk]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fortune Teller", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Oracle", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn how many dead players are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Monk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (not yourself): they are safe from the Demon tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alsaahir", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach day, if you publicly guess which players are Minion(s) and which are Demon(s), good wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Seamstress", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, at night, choose 2 players (not yourself): you learn if they are the same alignment."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cannibal", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have the ability of the recently killed executee. If they are evil, you are poisoned until a good player dies by execution."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Banshee", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf the Demon kills you, all players learn this. From now on, you may nominate twice per day and vote twice per nomination."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hermit", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have all Outsider abilities. [-0 or -1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \"mad\" about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Zealot", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive, you must vote for every nomination."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Puzzlemaster", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n1 player is drunk, even if you die. If you guess (once) who it is, learn the Demon player, but guess wrong & get false info."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Poisoner", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned tonight and tomorrow day."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Witch", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: if they nominate tomorrow, they die. If just 3 players live, you lose this ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Cerenovus", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player & a good character: they are \"mad\" they are this character tomorrow, or might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wizard", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nOnce per game, choose to make a wish. If granted, it might have a price & leave a clue as to its nature."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Wraith", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou may choose to \"open your eyes\" at night. You wake when other evil players do."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Vigormortis", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. Minions you kill keep their ability & poison 1 Townsfolk neighbor. [-1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lord of Typhon", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. [Evil characters are in a line. You are in the middle. +1 Minion. -? to +? Outsiders]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "FABLED", "bold": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Djinn", "color": "gold", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gold"}, "\nUse the Djinn's special rule. All players know what it is. (Speak with Storyteller)"]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Irrational Behaviour Script", "italic": false, "color": "green", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Irrational Behaviour\"", "italic": false, "color": "green"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]